      "details": "\r\n<p>Hippana is listed as \"Monte dei Cavalli\" in the <em>BTCGI</em>. The association can be also found in the <em>Barrington Atlas</em>, while Manni 1981 suggests more generically the area of the nearby town of Prizzi.</p>\r\n",
